        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "Tropical Tree Diversity: Rainforest Structure, Emergents, Epiphytes",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "Cauliflory = flowers and fruits borne directly on the trunk or major branches, rather than on young twig tips."
    },
    {
      "id": "06-TROPICAL-TREES.md#015",
      "path": [
        "06-TROPICAL-TREES.md"
