      "text": "Why cauliflory in tropics?\n  --> Large-bodied frugivores (tapirs, peccaries, agoutis, large bats)\n      cannot reach twig tips but can access trunk\n  --> Large heavy fruits (cacao, breadfruit, jackfruit) too heavy for twigs\n  --> Bat pollination: trunk flowers are more accessible in flight corridor"
